breakpoints -- points at which the design of a page visually changes based on screen size

input responsive design notes into github from meta (notebook)

ex : "col-md-4" : at a md screen size one column will be 8 sections wide one will be 4 at other breakpoints this will not apply boxes will be auto formatted

ex : "col-lg-8 col-md-6": at lg screen size col will be 8, at md col will be 6

if you want a responsive presentation at all breakpoints, define each col size in class

<div class = "row align-items-end"> : rows/cols they contain align to the end of their container
